{
  "id": "bdd",
  "term": "BDD",
  "definition": "BDD, or body dysmorphic disorder, is a psychological condition in which a person’s appearance-related worries are psychological in nature, but they may not recognize this and may instead seek cosmetic or medical help. Shame, stigma, and frequent misunderstanding of the symptoms can make getting appropriate psychological support difficult.",
